---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="IST Web V2 | Astro Foundation"
  description="Nền tảng Astro tĩnh cho website In Sáng Tạo IST."
  canonical="/"
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-black px-6 py-16 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-3xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-8 md:p-12">
      <img
        src="/images/logo-ist.png"
        alt="Logo In Sáng Tạo IST"
        class="mb-8 h-16 w-auto object-contain"
      />

      <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-500 uppercase">
        IST Web V2
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black leading-tight md:text-6xl">
        Astro migration foundation
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
        Đây là shell kiểm chứng build, Tailwind, metadata và public assets. Homepage production sẽ được migrate ở phase riêng.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
